cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in research, please cite the specific archived version you
  pinned, not the repository in general. Each release has its own version DOI; see the
  "Archived releases" table in README.md.
title: research-core
abstract: >-
  Shared substrate for the scala-tessella research programme on tilings: exact rational
  and cyclotomic arithmetic, the Delaney-Dress symbol engine, the exact angle/moduli
  layer, exported algebraic rank witnesses, the U(z) class machinery, and a SAT/DRAT
  certification harness. No theorems live here; individual results live in their own
  verification repositories and depend on a pinned release.
type: software
